title: Two files made by another program two seconds apart both get a card
folders: edit-odd
limit: 50
expect-log: files were added or removed, scanning again
expect-log: scanned 'edit-odd': 14 files

wait 3000
touch made_first.txt one
wait 2000
touch made_second.txt two
wait 6000
left files
wait 500
mark both-made
wait 400
goto made_second.txt
wait 1500
mark second-selected
wait 400
quit
